{"game": "risk-of-rain-2013", "language": "english", "appid": 248820, "month": "2016-06", "window": 3, "start_date": 1466035200, "end_date": 1466639999, "month_true_total": 175, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-07 09:11:42 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "23709500", "author": {"steamid": "76561198072040665", "personaname": "Gh0sT", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/everythingisREDACTED/", "num_games_owned": 665, "num_reviews": 34, "playtime_forever": 438, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 288, "last_played": 1466616488, "avatar": "52a78b436ef3e4874445e296d93f2406aaaa41e5"}, "language": "english", "review": ":DISCLOSURE:  I received a copy for the purpose of review. That in NO way affects the outcome of this review. If a game is crap IMO I will say so. Thank you Steamified.\n\nRisk of Rain is an intense rogue like. The game play is fantastic classic 8/16 bit platformer action. You have four abilities to aid you in the journey of survival. Twelve different characters you can play. Three game modes that scale well, the easiest of which does not allow the saving of progress. Combine all this with TONS of items that offer passive and on use advantages. The item combos can get crazy, like in The Binding of Issac. AND if you get more than one of an item it will stack. \n\nThis game is great if you have only 15min to play or 5 hours to play. Easy to pick up and get the hang of, but difficult to master no doubt. If you are new to rogue like games this is a great intro to the genre. Overall I would rate this game 8/10. It is a must play for any rogue like fan.", "timestamp_created": 1466614879, "timestamp_updated": 1466615851, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 12, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.576193153858184814", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_